    "detailed_description": "&quot;Ascension to the Bheaven&quot; is a thrilling parkour-based rage game that challenges players to ascend through a series of increasingly difficult obstacles. Inspired by the unforgiving gameplay of &quot;Getting Over It,&quot; this game requires precision, patience, and resilience. Players will navigate through a beautifully crafted world, pushing the limits of their parkour skills to reach new heights. With its intense gameplay and the constant threat of losing progress, &quot;Ascension to the Bheaven&quot; promises an adrenaline-pumping experience for those daring enough to take on its challenge. Use the grappling hook, set the record and slide to the victory!",
